[{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"太行何崔巍，千崖界空紫。\n异日吴使君，功名亦如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18654,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"使君本人杰，挟策游蓬莱。\n朱颜映绿鬓，片诺雨花台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18655,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"雨花台上游，黄金馆头别。\n一鸣空骥群，排云叩阊阖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18656,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"阊阖皇皇开，青袍脱蒙茸。\n烨如太阿剑，白昼飞神锋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18657,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"神锋入腕飞，青冥掣雷电。\n上考书吴公，第一明光殿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18658,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其七","author":"胡应麟","text":"明光寄陕服，朱幡沧海头。\n东方簇千骑，出入偕轩輶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18659,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其八","author":"胡应麟","text":"高轩惠然来，光照寒士寓。\n笑揖大将军，争誇汲长孺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18660,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其九","author":"胡应麟","text":"亡论汲生戆，祗益卫侯贤。\n何限飞沉事，黄梁二十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18661,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河梁话旧十绝句送左辖吴公之山西 其十","author":"胡应麟","text":"分携二十霜，腾踔九万里。\n高咏河梁篇，涕泪尽知己。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18662,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"一代丝纶寄，千秋保障名。\n高牙拥大旆，西入晋阳城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18663,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"白头徒自新，倾盖俨如故。\n蔽芾越东西，棠阴十万户。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18664,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"飞鸿游碧汉，尺鲋泳沧浪。\n脉脉穷交意，相看大海旁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18665,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"当年京兆府，一面睹荆州。\n讵意飞腾速，鳞符觐玉旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18666,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"百吏咸趋风，千官竞回席。\n人生得意年，天门骋八翼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18667,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"旬宣既南国，保釐复西土。\n著绣还故乡，朱节震华鼓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18668,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其七","author":"胡应麟","text":"灵泉汇九漈，澒洞浮苍云。\n飞书乞佳梦，为报九何君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18669,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其八","author":"胡应麟","text":"左淬莫耶锋，右淬干将锷。\n宇宙两神龙，延津当昼跃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18670,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其九","author":"胡应麟","text":"楼船济汾河，中流渺云雾。\n耐可鲜荔枝，不到桑乾渡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18671,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送左辖吴公十绝句 其十","author":"胡应麟","text":"烨烨承明庐，上考书第一。\n白首洛阳才，呻吟卧蓬荜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18672,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"开卷小酬岁月，出门便畏风尘。\n十洲三岛游客，万壑千峰主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18673,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"谁言名教乐地，懒著沐猴衣冠。\n午睡不知日落，晏起欲废朝餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18674,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"科头不出城郭，散步或傍檐楹。\n前身灌园处士，今代闭户先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18675,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"尼父六经日诵，邺侯四部时开。\n领取千秋万世，从他九棘三槐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18676,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"小草自甘惭忸，大椿终古逍遥。\n不梦有莘五鼎，高挂箕山一瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18677,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长夏闭关散发高卧吟诵之暇时或焚香鼓琴殊有羲皇之适信笔六首 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"东郭飞花晏坐，北堂芳杜晨兴。\n回驭王阳自得，绝裾温峤何能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18678,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"桃花夹水千树，柳色垂堤万重。\n何处数声鸡犬，人家只在前峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18679,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"南涧新篁雨过，西岭长松日斜。\n散发孤亭相对，忘言一卷南华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18680,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"窗北寒光露满，篱东暮色云低。\n地僻黄花自采，天空白酒谁携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18681,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画四首 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"千岭槎牙古树，万峰摇落孤梅。\n试问长安高卧，何如剡曲空回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18682,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"千劫总归眼底，万缘不入胸中。\n散发狂歌宇宙，侧身高卧崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18683,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"朝见许由行逊，暮看虞舜明扬。\n黄屋翻成重累，不如枯坐禅床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18684,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"千古登坛大帅，一时出塞诸侯。\n试较两家得失，莫将毛颖轻投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18685,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"户外时时狞狗，床头日日晨鸡。\n可道敬通戚戚，须知玄靖栖栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18686,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"烂漫图书自惜，萧条门户谁持。\n莫笑枚乘年老，游梁剩见佳儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18687,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端居述怀六首 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"二女九男有底，三公七贵无由。\n架上乾坤万卷，毫端日月千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18688,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园中四时歌 其一 春","author":"胡应麟","text":"北郭寻芳冉冉，西园载酒迟迟。\n晓日含花紫燕，春风绕树黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18689,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园中四时歌 其二 夏","author":"胡应麟","text":"午日阴阴枕簟，凉风习习窗纱。\n绿染芭蕉一丈，红舒菡萏千家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18690,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园中四时歌 其三 秋","author":"胡应麟","text":"偶约南邻二客，扁舟湖上从容。\n不省停桡何处，秋光万顷芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18691,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"园中四时歌 其四 冬","author":"胡应麟","text":"白帢孤吟蹇卫，红裙低唱羔羊。\n何似陶家学士，龙团煮雪溪堂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18692,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客岁病留瓜步且三月今年春仲复过此值江鱼大上每至友人家玉尺银条咄嗟便具殊厌馋口余越中不能尔也","author":"胡应麟","text":"夜夜三更瀫水，年年三月扬州。\n饱食河豚江鲚，何论越鸟吴牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18693,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其一","author":"胡应麟","text":"翠靥霞生玉镜，红妆日耀金钿。\n后院花开百合，前庭柳学三眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18694,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其二","author":"胡应麟","text":"妙舞谁同静婉，清歌莫辨娇娆。\n绮阁珠帘半捲，画堂银烛高烧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18695,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其三","author":"胡应麟","text":"腻玉搓成素颈，松云绾就乌丝。\n乍夜灵光赋就，人人高唱新词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18696,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其四","author":"胡应麟","text":"灼灼朱唇澄雾，亭亭素面迎风。\n夜合花梢月上，王昌近在墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18697,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其五","author":"胡应麟","text":"西北浮云隐隐，帘垂百尺高楼。\n罗袖风前试卷，玉钗斜拨箜篌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18698,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其六","author":"胡应麟","text":"宝屧参差步障，银缸烂漫窗纱。\n一扫如椽万字，酣歌笑拥如花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18699,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其七","author":"胡应麟","text":"杳杳笙歌院落，煌煌灯火楼台。\n十二金钗对舞，三千玉蝶齐开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18700,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其八","author":"胡应麟","text":"缥缈湘裾曳地，翩褼洛袜凌波。\n院院红绡国色，莫将磨勒来过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18701,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其九","author":"胡应麟","text":"赵媛燕姬作队，秦娥卫女成行。\n尽日纶巾羽扇，弦歌豆蔻花傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":18702,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富贵曲十二首 其十","author":"胡应麟","text":"骤见争如易别，相思入骨难禁。\n南陌花开并蒂，西陵草结